/github.com/lobsters/lobsters/issues/1165) I'm [working at](https://github.com/lobsters/lobsters/pull/2229) that turned out to have some interesting refactoring suggested by the [admins](https://github.com/orgs/lobsters/people). Does anybody want to pair-code this feat with me? (I also mentioned it in irc). I believe discussing the codebase would be incredibly helpful for me and others wiling to contribute to Lobsters. I'm not a super experienced programmer and I'm not sure yet how to organize this kind of pair-work but thought mentioning it here would be worth a shot and super fun thing to do :D\r\n\r\nPS: Of course [no llm contribution is allowed](https://github.com/lobsters/lobsters/blob/main/AGENTS.md), just crude old style brain smashing! \u003c3","submitter_user":"rebeca","user_is_author":true,"tags":["ask","meta","ruby"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/mgy3tr","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/mgy3tr/pair_coding_lobste_rs_feat"},{"short_id":"3jyfg9","created_at":"2026-10-28T09:23:20.818-05:00","title":"Making SIMD Code Scale to Any Vector Width","url":"https://streamhpc.com/blog/2026-10-28/making-simd-code-scale-to-any-vector-width/","score":5,"flags":0,"comment_count":0,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"MyNameIsTrez","user_is_author":false,"tags":["assembly","c++","graphics","performance"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/3jyfg9","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/3jyfg9/making_simd_code_scale_any_vector_width"},{"short_id":"mnazv8","created_at":"2026-10-28T09:03:03.411-05:00","title":"The October inflection point for vibe game development","url":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/28/vibe-game-development/","score":-2,"flags":23,"comment_count":15,"description":"","description_plain":"","submitter_user":"simonw","user_is_author":true,"tags":["building-ai-tooling","games"],"short_id_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/mnazv8","comments_url":"https://lobste.rs/s/mnazv8/october_inflection_point_for_vibe_game"},{"short_id":"hqcvyj","crea